{"overview":"*The Table: K-Chef 2026* سرآشپزهای برتر کره را برای رقابت بر سر عنوان بهترین سرآشپز کشور گرد هم می‌آورد؛ سرآشپز مشهور جهانی کریس K. (که به نام کانگ هان، سونگی نیز شناخته می‌شود) برای نجات رستورانش می‌جنگد، سرآشپز ستاره‌دار کامل‌گرا وو-جین و سرآشپزهایی با داستان‌های شخصی خود در نبردی سرسخت آشپزی روبه‌رو می‌شوند؛ بیش از یک مسابقه، آن‌ها در غذا و یکدیگر آرامش می‌یابند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"The Table: K-Chef 2026 brings together Korea's top chefs to compete for the title of the country's best chef. Mysterious world-renowned chef Chris K., also known as Kang Han, Song-yi, who is fighting to save her restaurant, perfectionist star chef Woo-jin, and chefs with stories of their own face off in a fierce culinary battle. More than a competition, they find comfort in food and one another.","tagline_en":"Bring the perfect dish to life.","runtime":null,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":12,"y":2026,"poster":"/mrM4JbNYY0fqzinlE0qNthLxVf6.jpg"}],"episodes":12,"crew":["Kim Do-hoon"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["KR"],"cast":[{"name":"آن هیو سوپ","role":"Kang Han / Chris K","photo":"/hVnKQ5WO8MGFrm6ShPmL90NZloV.jpg","en":"Ahn Hyo-seop"},{"name":"홍화연","role":"Choi Song-i","photo":"/XzUpzJuGHsghd1ZolrFU7JIXOV.jpg","en":"Hong Hwa-yeon"},{"name":"장률","role":"Cha Woo-jin","photo":"/ad3JzZUeo9jj3UpRK4NoYioCIxQ.jpg","en":"Chang Ryul"},{"name":"정유진","role":"Seon Jeong-won","photo":"/iiY8UUU93EjutlfRrTZTPm566d6.jpg","en":"Eugene Jung"},{"name":"장영남","role":"Moon Hae-seon","photo":"/u0hl8WSswFhKVaKwaMAERU0xUJk.jpg","en":"Jang Young-nam"},{"name":"차지연","role":"Baek Hyeon-ju","photo":"/6ntm2nrIvIcb8ifMpyalDNaUVoF.jpg","en":"Cha Ji-yeon"},{"name":"Lee Je-hyeong","role":"Hall staff 2","photo":"/6uHH9mvl3l1yysO8yvOcaT05YSS.jpg"},{"name":"Bret Allan Lindquist","role":"Belgium - Chef A","photo":"/9K51gOdC3OU1SPmIiwvrgshOPQn.jpg"},{"name":"곽민호","role":"Special appearance","photo":"/6VQRu8TFY5iqBsDDMuIeCFBxkU5.jpg","en":"Kwak Min-ho"}],"trailer":"eojaHI